{%- comment -%}
  LIFE GROUPS HERO — the Life Groups page's hero (Assets/Lava/Partials/
  VideoHero.lava, Styles/_video-hero.scss), as Renew's, Outreach's and Care's.

  Block:                    an HTML block in the Life Groups page's Feature zone
  Block content:            {% include '~~/Assets/Lava/LifegroupsHero.lava' %}
  Enabled Lava Commands:    none
  Page:                     InnerDefault, PageHeaderStyle Hidden, DarkHeader
                            checked

  The lead line under "Life Groups" is the page's Description (Page
  Properties). The button jumps to Join a group on this page.
  No video yet: a labelled green placeholder stands in. When the video is in
  Rock, delete heroPlaceholder and set heroMediaId to its media element id.

  The page content under it: Assets/Lava/Lifegroups.lava (Main zone).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign heroPlaceholder = 'Video: Life Groups' -%}
{%- capture heroActions -%}
  <a class="btn btn--primary" href="#join">Find a group</a>
{%- endcapture -%}
{% include '~~/Assets/Lava/Partials/VideoHero.lava' %}
